1
00:00:00,550 --> 00:00:03,763
听障使用者小林，正在去见朋友。
Xiaolin, a deaf or hard-of-hearing user, is on her way to meet a friend.

2
00:00:03,852 --> 00:00:08,438
她希望独自出行时，也能及时察觉身后的环境线索。
She wants to notice important cues behind her while travelling independently.

3
00:00:08,527 --> 00:00:11,420
SoundBridge，让声音成为触觉。
SoundBridge turns sound cues into touch.

4
00:00:12,550 --> 00:00:17,656
共享步道上，车铃从左后方传来。小林的目光仍然朝前。
A bicycle bell rings behind her on the left. Her attention is on the path ahead.

5
00:00:17,743 --> 00:00:22,028
声波抵达手表，四个麦克风先后接收同一次声音。
The sound reaches the watch. Four microphones receive the same event at different times.

6
00:00:22,114 --> 00:00:26,420
手表开始识别，让看不见的声音有了可感知的入口。
Recognition begins, giving an unseen sound a perceptible form.

7
00:00:27,550 --> 00:00:31,307
收音信号转换为频谱特征，端侧模型识别出车铃。
Audio is converted into spectral features. An on-device model identifies the bicycle bell.

8
00:00:31,386 --> 00:00:35,074
分类确认后，系统把声音类别与来向交给提醒模块。
Once confirmed, the sound class and direction are passed to the alert module.

9
00:00:35,152 --> 00:00:38,420
从外部声音，到腕上的线索，处理在本地完成。
From sound to a cue on the wrist, processing stays local.

10
00:00:39,550 --> 00:00:44,298
四个麦克风的位置不同，声音到达的时间也有细微差异。
The four microphones occupy different positions, so sound reaches them at slightly different times.

11
00:00:44,384 --> 00:00:49,220
比较四路信号的先后，阵列估算声音相对手表的来向。
Comparing the four arrival times estimates direction relative to the watch.

12
00:00:49,305 --> 00:00:55,387
左后方、左前方、右前方、右后方，表盘的指针和角度同步变化。
Rear left, front left, front right, rear right: the dial pointer and angle move together.

13
00:00:55,472 --> 00:01:00,420
来向不明确时，只显示声音类别，让她自己观察确认。
If direction is unclear, show the sound class and let her check her surroundings.

14
00:01:01,550 --> 00:01:05,230
小林的手腕感到三次短振，她抬腕查看。
Xiaolin feels three short pulses and glances at her watch.

15
00:01:05,316 --> 00:01:09,186
表盘同时显示车铃、角度和方位文字。
The dial shows the bell, its approximate angle and a direction label.

16
00:01:09,272 --> 00:01:12,420
声音不必成为她回应环境的唯一入口。
Hearing does not have to be her only way to notice the world.

17
00:01:13,550 --> 00:01:17,410
有了来向线索，她转头观察，确认骑行者的位置。
With a directional cue, she looks around and locates the cyclist.

18
00:01:17,494 --> 00:01:21,372
她在步道一侧让出空间，等对方通过，再继续前行。
She makes space at the side, lets the rider pass, then continues.

19
00:01:21,456 --> 00:01:24,420
手表提供线索，行动由她自己决定。
The watch provides a cue. The decision remains hers.

20
00:01:25,550 --> 00:01:28,462
适合自己的提醒，才容易被理解。
A cue that suits the person is easier to understand.

21
00:01:28,547 --> 00:01:32,870
她选择关注的声音，调节振动强度，也可以放大文字。
She chooses sounds, adjusts vibration strength and can enlarge the text.

22
00:01:32,955 --> 00:01:36,420
左侧选中的设置，会立即呈现在手表上。
Each selected control is reflected immediately on the watch.

23
00:01:37,550 --> 00:01:42,278
回到家，小林正专注于手里的事情，门铃响起。
At home, Xiaolin is focused on what she is doing when the doorbell rings.

24
00:01:42,349 --> 00:01:46,957
两组双振和门铃文字，让来访信息抵达手腕。
Two paired pulses and a doorbell label bring the visitor cue to her wrist.

25
00:01:47,028 --> 00:01:51,420
她可以从容地结束手头的事，再决定何时回应。
She can finish what she is doing and choose when to respond.

26
00:01:52,550 --> 00:01:55,921
这份提醒，来自表壳内各个部件的协作。
This cue is created by components working together inside the case.

27
00:01:56,006 --> 00:02:01,075
收音阵列、处理电路、显示模组和触觉马达，逐层展开。
The microphone array, processing board, display and haptic actuator separate into layers.

28
00:02:01,161 --> 00:02:05,420
看清信号如何流动后，部件沿原来的位置平稳收回。
After revealing the signal path, the layers settle smoothly back into place.

29
00:02:06,550 --> 00:02:10,656
她也可以暂停监听，为自己留一段安静的时间。
She can also pause listening and take time for herself.

30
00:02:10,756 --> 00:02:15,420
暂停状态持续可见；准备好了，再由她主动恢复。
The paused state stays visible. She chooses when to resume.

31
00:02:16,550 --> 00:02:21,400
声音在本地处理，私人的日常，留在自己的掌控中。
Sound is processed locally, keeping her everyday life under her control.

32
00:02:22,550 --> 00:02:26,525
从独自出门，到与朋友相聚，生活按自己的节奏展开。
From heading out alone to meeting a friend, life moves at her own pace.

33
00:02:26,615 --> 00:02:29,420
SoundBridge，让重要的线索，被感知。
SoundBridge. Make important cues perceptible.
